From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mainui: gamepad axis names in the language of the menus

The axis binding map of the gamepad menu showed the names of the axes
("Side", "Forward", ...) translated only until the first change: the
spin controls take their text from the model, an array of the English
names. The model now has them translated.
---
 3rdparty/mainui/menus/Gamepad.cpp | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/3rdparty/mainui/menus/Gamepad.cpp b/3rdparty/mainui/menus/Gamepad.cpp
--- a/3rdparty/mainui/menus/Gamepad.cpp
+++ b/3rdparty/mainui/menus/Gamepad.cpp
@@ -308,7 +308,12 @@
 {
 	int i, y;
 
-	static CStringArrayModel model( axisNames, V_ARRAYSIZE( axisNames ) );
+	// the names of the axes in the language of the menus
+	static const char *axisNamesLocalized[V_ARRAYSIZE( axisNames )];
+	static CStringArrayModel model( axisNamesLocalized, V_ARRAYSIZE( axisNamesLocalized ) );
+
+	for( i = 0; i < V_ARRAYSIZE( axisNames ); i++ )
+		axisNamesLocalized[i] = L( axisNames[i] );
 
 	banner.SetPicture( ART_BANNER );
 
-- 
